{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/Computer.gif?t=1747723386\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Nest is a first-person psychological horror adventure game that blends a walking simulator and point-and-click mechanics, all within a dark and psychological atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will explore a secluded mansion, carefully examining their surroundings and discovering hidden clues to progress the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark and Atmospheric Environments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Detailed and Realistic Soundscapes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather Clues Through Varied Interactions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Something Lurks Within the Mansion...</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/Lamps.gif?t=1747723386\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/extras/passage.gif?t=1747723386\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751330?t=1747723386","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/b6ba205463993598cf75e8d7483aba15066db56a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747723386","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751330/95fe2807e3206fb6ae075c5ffad5054974f5da47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747723386","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama